{"repositoryId":314983546,"availability":"available","full":"kurotu/VRCQuestTools","name":"VRCQuestTools","description":"Unity editor extension to support uploading VRChat avatars for Oculus Quest","category":"Developer tools","language":"C#","stars":374,"forks":32,"created":"2020-11-22T07:33:11Z","updated":"2026-10-18T15:22:35Z","license":"MIT","branch":"master","homepage":"https://kurotu.github.io/VRCQuestTools/","topics":["vrchat"],"demo":"https://kurotu.github.io/VRCQuestTools/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-19T18:05:02.918Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-19T18:05:02.918Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-19T18:05:02.918Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-19T18:05:02.918Z","stars":374,"forks":32}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Avatar Converter and Utilities for Mobile (Android, iOS).","VRCQuestTools is a Unity editor extension which converts PC VRChat avatars so they can also be used on Android (Quest, PICO) and iOS. The Android and iOS versions of VRChat are collectively called Mobile below.","VRCQuestTools は、PC 用の VRChat アバターを Android (Quest, PICO) や iOS でも使えるように変換する Unity エディター拡張です。 以下では、Android 版と iOS 版の VRChat をまとめて Mobile と呼びます。"],"features":["Material conversion: Reads the settings of PC shaders and automatically generates materials and textures for Mobile-supported shaders.","Removal of unsupported components: Removes components which can't be used on Mobile at build time.","Non-destructive conversion: With Non-Destructive Modular Framework (NDMF), avatars are automatically converted on upload without creating a copy in the scene.","PhysBone reduction support: Helps you reduce PhysBones to fit within the performance limits.","Various utilities: Provides tools which help Mobile support, such as copying blendshapes and applying recommended Unity settings."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/kurotu/VRCQuestTools/blob/master/README.md","fingerprint":"648db92ee929c1d4fb2bc5525dcf032d2423e1cd8e9a39f8752b0ad48